<para><programlisting filename=".markdown"><codeline><highlight class="normal">```mermaid</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">flowchart<sp/>TD</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>A[Start]<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>B[Initialize<sp/>device,<sp/>GPIO,<sp/>PIE,<sp/>and<sp/>I2C<sp/>modules]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>B<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>C[Enable<sp/>I2C<sp/>internal<sp/>loopback<sp/>mode]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>C<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>D[Transmit<sp/>data<sp/>using<sp/>TX<sp/>FIFO<sp/>interrupts]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>D<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>E[Receive<sp/>data<sp/>using<sp/>RX<sp/>FIFO<sp/>interrupts]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>E<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>F[Validate<sp/>received<sp/>data<sp/>against<sp/>expected<sp/>pattern]</highlight></codeline>
